# Design (MW2 / LU4)

Dark fantasy game-site feel: deep charcoal/ink backgrounds, warm gold/amber accents, dense data table, strong brand «LU4-RB».

## Do

- Keep dark theme as default (`class="dark"` on `html`)
- Brand name is hero-level on login and header — not a tiny nav label
- Expressive display font for brand/headings; readable body font — never default Inter/Roboto/Arial/system stacks
- Atmosphere via subtle gradients / vignette / grain — not flat single-color pages
- One job per section; keep the RB table as the main surface after login
- Mobile-first: horizontal scroll for table OK; keep primary actions reachable

## Don't

- Purple-on-white / purple-indigo AI gradient clichés
- Warm cream + terracotta newspaper look
- Card grids in the hero; decorative glow spam; emoji clusters
- Flat white dashboard chrome that could belong to any SaaS

## Status colors

- Waiting — muted/secondary
- Possible respawn — amber/gold emphasis
- Fully respawned — destructive/red
- No timer — outline/neutral
